---
---
<section class="bg-gray-50 mt-20" >
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mb-12 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-bricolage tracking-wider mb-4 text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
        Stop guessing, start <span class="text-brand">listening</span>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
        
        <div class="bg-rose-100 rounded-2xl p-6 text-rose-700 dark:bg-rose-900/40 dark:text-rose-300">
          <h3 class="font-bricolage tracking-wider text-xl font-medium">Without qare</h3>
          <p class="mb-4 italic">Building in the dark...</p>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-lg">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414  1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414  1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0  01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z" />
              </svg>
              <p>Your users leave without telling you what they think</p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414  1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414  1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0  01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z" />
              </svg>
              <p>You're wasting 3 months building features that nobody uses</p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414  1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414  1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0  01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z" />
              </svg>
              <p>No easy way to collect feedback without coding</p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414  1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414  1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0  01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z" />
              </svg>
              <p>Monthly payments for complex solutions that aren't worth it</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-emerald-100 rounded-2xl  p-6 text-emerald-700 dark:bg-emerald-900/40 dark:text-emerald-300">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <h3 class="font-bricolage tracking-wider text-xl font-medium">With qare</h3>
            <span class="bg-emerald-700/20 rounded-2xl px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700 dark:bg-emerald-300/20 dark:text-emerald-300">
              RECOMMENDED
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="mb-4 italic">Building with confidence...</p>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-lg">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" />
              </svg>
              <p>Understand what your users love and what needs improvement</p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" />
              </svg>
              <p>Ship features that 10x revenue by listening to what users want</p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" />
              </svg>
              <p>Collect feedback in 1 minute no coding, no delays</p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" />
              </svg>
              <p>One-time payment no monthly fees, no hidden costs</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>    
</section>
